# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets out of it.
#
# `.env.local` holds SHELTER_API_KEY, which authorises subscriber registration and
# satellite broadcasts. A build context is readable by every layer, so an
# accidentally-copied env file is a leaked key even if no Dockerfile line
# references it.

node_modules
.next
out
.netlify

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

.git
.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
